  "notes": "Implemented execSync command whitelist for heartbeat-daemon.ts. Changes: (1) Added ALLOWED_COMMANDS whitelist (ps, kill, wait, uptime, date, tsc, npx, node, npm). (2) Added SHELL_METACHAR_REGEX to reject injection characters [;&|`$()]. (3) Added validateCommand() exported function with empty/null-byte/metachar/whitelist checks. (4) Applied validateCommand() before every execSync call with ValidationError catch. (5) Reduced timeout from 120s to 5s (HEARTBEAT_EXEC_TIMEOUT). (6) 15 tests covering: allowed commands, 6 metachar injections, non-whitelisted commands, empty/whitespace, null bytes, path prefix handling. Pre-existing failures in task-builder (2), commands (1), error-handling-unification (1) are unrelated.",
